半端な状態で\nうろうろされても困るし、\nちゃんと治るまで大人しくしててネ","translation":"就是就是。身体半好不好的，到处乱跑，我们也很困扰。彻底养好之前都要乖乖的喵。","model":"ferris_dress01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg076d_roswaal","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10030006:24","scenario_id":24,"scene_id":"scene:10030006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"……そうだな。わかったよ","translation":"……也是。我知道了。","model":"subaru_gown01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg076d_roswaal","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040001:1","scenario_id":1,"scene_id":"scene:10040001","kind":"title","title_mode":"scene","speaker":"","text":"四度目の果物屋","translation":"第四次来到水果摊","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"","source_scenario_id":null},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040001:2","scenario_id":2,"scene_id":"scene:10040001","kind":"text","title_mode":"","speaker":"","text":"――自分の身に起きている現象について、あ\nる仮定が芽生えるスバル。が、チンピラに刺\nされ、気付けばまたも果物屋の前に……","translation":"——对于发生在自己身上的现象，昴心中浮现出一个假说。然而，被混混刺伤后，回过神时，他又站在了水