","text":"オイ、兄ちゃん。そこで何しとる？うちのミミになんか用なんか？","translation":"喂，小哥。你在那里干什么？找我们家蜜蜜有事吗？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020034:25","scenario_id":25,"scene_id":"scene:10020034","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"リカード","text":"あー、えらいすまんすまん……って、なんやねん!なんでワイが謝らなならんのや！","translation":"啊，真不好意思……等等，搞什么啊！为什么变成我道歉了！","model":"ricardo01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020034:26","scenario_id":26,"scene_id":"scene:10020034","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ミミ","text":"あ、ダンチョー！","translation":"啊，团长！","model":"mimi01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020034:27","scenario_id":27,"scene_id":"scene:10020034","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"リカード","text":"おう、ミミ！勝手に離れたらあかんやろ！で、この目つきの悪い兄ちゃんは……","translation":"哦，蜜蜜！不是叫你别随便跑开吗！所以，这位眼神凶恶的小哥是……","model":"ricardo01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020034:28","scenario_id":28,"scene_id":"scene:10020034","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ミミ","text":"んん~、まったく知らん!けど、チョーいいひと！すごーおいしいものくれた！ゼンニン!","translation":"嗯——完全不认识！不过，是个超级好的人！给了我特别好吃的东西！大好人！","model":"mimi01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020034:29","scenario_id":29,"scene_id":"scene:10020034","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"リカード","text":"ほー、そうなんか。\nそれやったら、ミミが世話になってもうた\nみたいやし、なんや礼でもせんとな","translation":"哦，这样啊。既然你照顾了蜜蜜，我们也得好好感谢你才行。","model":"ricardo01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020034:30","scenario_id":30,"scene_id":"scene:10020034","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"だったら、道が聞きたい。貧民街の、盗品蔵ってとこなんだが","translation":"那我想问个路。贫民街有个叫赃物库的地方……","model":"su