":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ミミ","text":"そんな感じ？よかったよかった。これにて、一件落着！","translation":"是这样吗？太好了太好了。这样就圆满解决啦！","model":"mimi01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg027a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020035:45","scenario_id":45,"scene_id":"scene:10020035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"それは少し気が早いけど……けど、二人には世話になった","translation":"现在说这个还早了点……不过，真的多亏你们两个了。","model":"subaru01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg027a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020035:46","scenario_id":46,"scene_id":"scene:10020035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"リカード","text":"なに、兄ちゃんがええならええねん。そしたら、ワイらはそろそろ引き上げ時やと思うんやけど、構わんか?","translation":"没什么，你满意就好。那么，我们也差不多该走了，可以吗？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg027a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020035:47","scenario_id":47,"scene_id":"scene:10020035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"リカード","text":"なんや、気合