,"kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"これまたずいぶんと大雑把だネ。\n時間がなくて正確な場所もわからないとか、\n頼りにゃいにもほどがあるよ","translation":"还真是够笼统的。没时间，又不知道准确地点，未免太不靠谱了喵。","model":"ferris_dress01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020021:35","scenario_id":35,"scene_id":"scene:10020021","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"わかっただろ？だからこそ、急がなくちゃならねえ！","translation":"明白了吧？所以才必须赶快啊！","model":"subaru01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020021:36","scenario_id":36,"scene_id":"scene:10020021","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィル爺","text":"ですが話を聞く限り、お一人で向かうには\nいささか危険な状況にあると\n判断せざるを得ませんな","translation":"但依您所言，情况颇为危险，实在不宜独自前往。","model":"wilhelm01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020021:37","scenario_id":37,"scene_id":"scene:10020021","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"どう考えてもそうだよネ。どうする？ヴィル爺","translation":"怎么看都是这样呢。怎么办，威尔爷？","model":"ferris_dress01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020021:38","scenario_id":38,"scene_id":"scene:10020021","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィル爺","text":"――では、その貧民街への道行き、\n私も同道させていただくというのは\nいかがですかな？","translation":"——那么，前往贫民街的这一路，可否容我同行？","model":"wilhelm01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020021:39","scenario_id":39,"scene_id":"scene:10020021","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"っ、いや、それは助かるけど、なんでそんな風に？","translation":"啊，那确实帮大忙了，可为什么愿意这样帮我？","model":"subaru01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020021:40","scenario_id":40,"scene_id":"scene:10020021","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィル爺","text":"あなたのお話が事実なら、一人の女性が\n危険な目に遭っているのでしょう。それを\n見過ごせば、我々の主に顔向けできません","translation":"如果您所言属实，就有一位女性正身处险境。对此视而不见，我们无颜面对自己的主人。","model":"wilhelm01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020021:41","scenario_id":41,"scene_id":"scene:10020021","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"フェリちゃんも同意見。\nヴィル爺、お願いしていい？","translation":"菲莉酱也这么想。威尔爷，能拜托你吗？","model":"ferris_dress01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020021:42","scenario_id":42,"scene_id":"scene:10020021","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィル爺","text":"ええ、もちろんです。それで、いかがされますか？","translation":"嗯，自然。那么，您意下如何？","model":"wilhelm01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020021:43","scenario_id":43,"scene_id":"scene:10020021","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"……ここで断れるほど、俺も状況を勘違いできてないですよ。正直、一人でどうしようつて思ってたとこですしね","translation":"……情况如何，我还不至于看不明白，也没资格推辞。老实说，我刚才正愁自己一个人该怎么办。","model":"subaru01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020021:44","scenario_id":44,"scene_id":"scene:10020021","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"お願いします！俺に力を貸してください！","translation":"拜托了！请助我一臂之力！","model":"subaru01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020021:45","scenario_id":45,"scene_id":"scene:10020021","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"承知しました。\n私のことはヴィルヘルムとお呼びください","translation":"明白了。请称呼我为威尔海姆。","model":"wilhelm01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg134a_castletown","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020021:46","scenario_id":46,"scene_id":"scene:10020021","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"俺はナツキ・スバルです。じゃあ、目指すは貧民街の、盗品蔵へ！","translation":"我叫菜月昴。那么，向贫民街的赃物库出发！","model":"subaru01",