scene:10150004","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"あらら、否定するかと思ったけど本当に興味あるんだ？","translation":"哎呀，还以为你会否认，看来真的有兴趣啊？","model":"ferris_dress01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150004:29","scenario_id":29,"scene_id":"scene:10150004","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"……ならば、ヴィルヘルム。\n卿もナツキ・スバルと共に、\n花壇の手入れをしてみてはどうだ？","translation":"……既然如此，威尔海姆，卿也与菜月昴一起照料花坛，如何？","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150004:30","scenario_id":30,"scene_id":"scene:10150004","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"。何を仰いますか、クルシユ様。私に花の世話など……","translation":"您这是说哪里话，库珥修大人。让我来照料花……","model":"wilhelm01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150004:31","scenario_id":31,"scene_id":"scene:10150004","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"にゃはは。ヴィル爺は無趣味だから、\nちょうどいいかもネ","translation":"喵哈哈，威尔爷没什么爱好，这说不定正好呢。","model":"ferris_dress01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150004:32","scenario_id":32,"scene_id":"scene:10150004","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"フェリスまで何を。それに、私にはやらねばならぬことが……","translation":"怎么连菲利丝也这么说。而且，我还有必须要做的事……","model":"wilhelm01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150004:33","scenario_id":33,"scene_id":"scene:10150004","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"ならば、これは命令だ。ナツキ・スバルと共に花壇の手入れをしろ","translation":"那这便是命令。与菜月昴一同照料花坛。","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150004:34","scenario_id":34,"scene_id":"scene:10150004","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"クルシュ様……","translation":"库珥修大人……","model":