","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"ふいー、\nやっとこ土作りも終わりましたね","translation":"呼，终于把土整好了啊。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:5","scenario_id":5,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"花壇の手入れとは、かくも手間のかかるものなのですな","translation":"照料花坛，竟是如此费时费力之事。","model":"wilhelm01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:6","scenario_id":6,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"まあ、手間暇かけた分だけ愛着も湧くし。\nこれでようやく花が植えられますけど……\nさて、何を植えたらいいんですかね？","translation":"不过，花的心思越多，也就越有感情。这样终于能种花了……那么，种什么好呢？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:7","scenario_id":7,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"ふむ、確かに指示されていませんな。確か花の種は物置にあったはず。いくつか持ってきてみましょう。","translation":"嗯，确实没有吩咐过。花种应该放在储物间里，我去取几种来。","model":"wilhelm01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:8","scenario_id":8,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"種を持ってはきましたが……種類がいくつかあるようです","translation":"种子是拿来了……不过，好像有好几种。","model":"wilhelm01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:9","scenario_id":9,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"朗報だけど、種の状態か……。\nこれだと、花の種類はさっぱりだな。\nヴィルヘルムさんはわかったり？","translation":"好消息，不过还是种子状态啊……光看这个，完全认不出是什么花。威尔海姆先生能看出来吗？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:10","scenario_id":10,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"生憎、花には疎いもので。ましてや種の状態となりますとお手上げです","translation":"遗憾的是，我不懂花卉。何况只是种子，更是束手无策。","model":"wilhelm01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:11","scenario_id":11,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"ですよねー。さて、いったいどうしたもんか……","translation":"也是啊。接下来该怎么办呢……","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:12","scenario_id":12,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"二人で顔を突き合わせて、何を相談しているところだ？","translation":"二位凑在一起，是在商量什么？","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:13","scenario_id":13,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"クルシュ様、\nこれはお恥ずかしいところを","translation":"库珥修大人，让您见笑了。","model":"wilhelm01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:14","scenario_id":14,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"なに、気にするな。\nヴィルヘルムも様になっているようだ。\n花壇も、大きな問題はなさそうだが？","translation":"无妨，不必介意。威尔海姆看起来也像模像样了。花坛似乎也没有什么大问题？","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:15","scenario_id":15,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"そうそう、ヴィルヘルムさん才能あるよ。仕事が丁寧なのと、雑草の息の根を容赦なく止めてくれっからね","translation":"没错，威尔海姆先生很有天分。干活仔细不说，还能毫不留情地斩断杂草的命根呢。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:16","scenario_id":16,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"二人で老骨をからかうのはおやめください。時にクルシュ様、植える花なのですが……","translation":"二位就别取笑我这把老骨头了。对了，库珥修大人，关于要种的花……","model":"wilhelm01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:17","scenario_id":17,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"ヴィルヘルムさんが種は見つけてくれたん\nですけど、どの種が何の花なのか、\n素人二人だとさすがにさっぱりで","translation":"威尔海姆先生找到了种子，不过哪种种子会开什么花，我们两个外行实在是看不出来。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:18","scenario_id":18,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"なるほど、道理だな。ならば私に見せてみるといい。名前がわかれば、花の種類もわかる","translation":"原来如此，确实有理。那便让我看看。认得名字，就知道是什么花了。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:19","scenario_id":19,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"こいつらなんだけど……","translation":"就是这些……","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:20","scenario_id":20,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"アガレス、エイリーク、それにダイアナか。これらは赤、これは青の花が咲く。あとの種は全て白い花のものだ","translation":"阿加雷斯、艾里克，还有戴安娜。这些开红花，这是蓝花。其余的种子，都开白花。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:21","scenario_id":21,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"へえ、さすが！詳しいんだな。やっぱり、よくもらったりするから？","translation":"哦，不愧是你，真了解啊。果然是因为经常收到花吗？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150005:22","scenario_id":22,"scene_id":"scene:10150005","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"いや、むしろ贈る側だ","translation":"不，倒不如说，我是送花的一方。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"pha