""},{"id":"10150006:17","scenario_id":17,"scene_id":"scene:10150006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"昨日なんて俺よりも早く花壇にきてたし、もしかすると花の世話が楽しくなってきたのかも、な一んてな","translation":"昨天甚至比我更早来到花坛。说不定，已经开始享受照料花的乐趣了。哈哈。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150006:18","scenario_id":18,"scene_id":"scene:10150006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"ふむ、そうか……。それはいい兆候だな","translation":"嗯，是吗……是个好兆头。","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150006:19","scenario_id":19,"scene_id":"scene:10150006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"はい?","translation":"啊？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150006:20","scenario_id":20,"scene_id":"scene:10150006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"いや、こちらの話だ","translation":"不，只是我自言自语。","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150006:21","scenario_id":21,"scene_id":"scene:10150006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"それにしても、卿もなかなかやるものだ。最初は卿の退屈しのぎになればと思って花壇の手入れを任せたものだが……","translation":"不过，卿也颇有本事。最初让卿照料花坛，只是希望能帮卿打发时间……","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150006:22","scenario_id":22,"scene_id":"scene:10150006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"いっそ、このまま庭師として\n卿を雇うのも悪くないかもしれないな","translation":"干脆就这样雇卿当园丁，似乎也不错。","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150006:23","scenario_id":23,"scene_id":"scene:10150006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"恩返しとは殊勝なものだ。とはいえ、前向きなら十分考慮に値する","translation":"想要报恩，确实难能可贵。既然卿也有意，这便值得认真考虑。","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150006:24","scenario_id":24,"scene_id":"scene:10150006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"ひとまず、保留としておこう。今は、芽吹いたばかりの芽を大事にしてやるといい。私も楽しみにしている","translation":"暂且搁置吧。现在好好照料那些刚冒头的嫩芽就好。我也很期待。","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150006:25","scenario_id":25,"scene_id":"scene:10150006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"ああ、了解。大げさだけど、命を預かる感覚だ。楽しみに待っててくれよな！","translation":"嗯，明白。虽然有点夸张，不过真有种被托付了生命的感觉。就好好期待吧！","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg122a_crusch","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10150006:26","scenario_id":26,"scene_id":"scene:10150006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"ふ。\nでは、励んでくれ、ナツキ・スバル","translation":"呵，那便用心做吧，菜月昴。","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_moti