200006:75","scenario_id":75,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ロズワール","text":"あなたとエミリア様の関係を思えば、彼はあなたたちの間者の可能性がある。そう易々と懐へ入れられるとでも？","translation":"想想您与爱蜜莉雅大人的关系，他也有可能是你们的间谍。您以为，我会轻易让他接近核心吗？","model":"roswaal01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:76","scenario_id":76,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"エミリア","text":"ちょっと、ロズワール！\nそんな言い方、失礼じゃない！","translation":"等等，罗兹瓦尔！这么说话，太失礼了！","model":"emilia01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:77","scenario_id":77,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"いや、いい、エミリア。\nメイザース辺境伯の言うことは正しい。\nその上で、卿の考えを正そう","translation":"不，无妨，爱蜜莉雅。梅札斯边境伯说得对。不过，在此前提下，也请容我纠正卿的想法。","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:78","scenario_id":78,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"王選において、私とエミリアの立場は明白。故に、卿が警戒するのは至極当然だ。だが、私はこんな見え透いた手は使わない","translation":"王选之中，我与爱蜜莉雅的立场十分明确。因此，卿有所戒备，理所当然。但我，不会用如此浅显的手段。","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:79","scenario_id":79,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ロズワール","text":"ほう？","translation":"哦？","model":"roswaal01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:80","scenario_id":80,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"私が対立する相手を討つなら、\nそんな小細工になど頼らず、堂々と攻める。\n正面から真っ向と。――それが答えだ","translation":"若我要击败与我对立之人，不会依赖这般雕虫小技，而会堂堂正正地进攻。从正面，迎头而战。——这便是答案。","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:81","scenario_id":81,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ロズワール","text":"なるほど。いやいや、さすがはクルシュ・カルステン公爵。そのみなぎる覇気が、何よりの証だ","translation":"原来如此。真不愧是库珥修·卡尔斯腾公爵。这洋溢而出的霸气，便是最好的证明。","model":"roswaal01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:82","scenario_id":82,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ロズワール","text":"そうまで言われては、食い下がるのも単なる下種の勘繰りというもの","translation":"既已说到这份上，我再纠缠，也不过是以小人之心度君子之腹。","model":"roswaal01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:83","scenario_id":83,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"……ってことは？","translation":"……也就是说？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:84","scenario_id":84,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ロズワール","text":"歓迎するよ、ナツキ・スバルくん。エミリア様の陣営へようこそ","translation":"欢迎，菜月昴。欢迎加入，爱蜜莉雅大人的阵营。","model":"roswaal01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:85","scenario_id":85,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"エミリア","text":"……そういうことでいいみたい。えっと、よろしくね？スバル","translation":"……看来，可以这样决定了。呃，以后请多关照，昴。","model":"emilia01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:86","scenario_id":86,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"お、おおおおッ!や、やった! やったぜ!","translation":"哦、哦哦哦哦！太、太好了！成功了！","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:87","scenario_id":87,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"ありがとう、クルシュさん！本当に俺、助けてもらってばっかで……","translation":"谢谢你，库珥修小姐！我真的，一直在受你们帮助……","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:88","scenario_id":88,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"……なんで、こんなに良くしてくれたんだ？","translation":"……为什么，要对我这么好？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:89","scenario_id":89,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"。ふむ、そうだな。いささか、返答に迷うところだが……","translation":"嗯，是啊。这个问题，让我略有些难以回答……","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:90","scenario_id":90,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"では、見返りを期待して、としておこう","translation":"那么，就当作是为了期待回报吧。","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:91","scenario_id":91,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"……それ、クルシュさんにー番似合わない答えだな","translation":"……这，可是最不像库珥修小姐会说的回答啊。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:92","scenario_id":92,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"クルシュ","text":"それがわかるぐらいには、卿が私を知る時間があったということだ","translation":"卿能明白这一点，就说明，我们确实有过足以相互了解的时光。","model":"crusch01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg096b_roswaal","source_scenario_id":8},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10200006:93","scenario_id":93,"scene_id":"scene:10200006","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"クルシュさん……。\n本当にありがとう。お世話になりました！","translation":"库珥修小姐……真的谢谢你。承蒙照顾了！","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emissio