xt":"奇遇でしたな。ここは……この花畑は、私と妻との思い出の場所なのです","translation":"真巧啊。这里……这片花田，是留有我与妻子回忆的地方。","model":"wilhelm01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg024a_slum","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10160010:16","scenario_id":16,"scene_id":"scene:10160010","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"奥さん、との……。\nそうだったんですか……","translation":"与您夫人的……原来如此……","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg024a_slum","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10160010:17","scenario_id":17,"scene_id":"scene:10160010","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"スバル殿、どうされましたか？ひどい顔色をなさっていますが","translation":"昴阁下，怎么了？您的脸色很难看。","model":"wilhelm01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg024a_slum","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10160010:18","scenario_id":18,"scene_id":"scene:10160010","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"あ、ええと、その……。\nちょっと、整理のつかないことが、あって","translation":"啊，那个……有些事，我还理不清头绪。","model":"","body":"","fa