:"……その言い方、昨日も引っかかったんだがあの子とクルシュさんに、どんな関係があるんだ？","translation":"……这个说法，昨天我就有点在意了。她和库珥修小姐，到底是什么关系？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg103a_forest","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10160011:19","scenario_id":19,"scene_id":"scene:10160011","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"スバルきゅんはどう思う？","translation":"小昴觉得呢？","model":"ferris_dress01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg103a_forest","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10160011:20","scenario_id":20,"scene_id":"scene:10160011","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"質問に質問で返すな、\nって言いたいとこだけど、そうだな。\n悪い関係ではなかった、と思う","translation":"本想说，别用问题回答问题……不过，我想想，应该不算糟糕的关系吧。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg103a_forest","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10160011:21","scenario_id":21,"scene_id":"scene:10160011","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"クルシュさんが、エミリアって子を嫌ってるようには見えなかったし","translation":"库珥修小姐，看起来并不讨厌那个