nd":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"巨大な体躯の老人","text":"ぶはははは！ 何を言い出すかと思えば。\n確かに死にかけのジジイなのは認めるが、\n生憎と死んだ経験はまだないぞ？","translation":"噗哈哈哈！还以为你要说什么。老夫的确是个半截身子入土的老头，可惜还没死过呢。","model":"rom01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg027a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020050:30","scenario_id":30,"scene_id":"scene:10020050","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"じゃあ、さっきまでのは全部夢だってのか？そんなはずねえだろ","translation":"那刚才发生的一切都是梦？怎么可能……","model":"subaru_tshirt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg027a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020050:31","scenario_id":31,"scene_id":"scene:10020050","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"巨大な体躯の老人","text":"それと、お前さんはともかく、\nそっちはここらにくる顔に見えんぞ。\n場違いにも限度があるじゃろう","translation":"还有，你也就罢了，旁边这位可不像会来这里的人。格格不入也该有个限度吧。","model":"rom01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg027a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10020050:32","scenario_id":32,"scene_id":"