てみろって","translation":"抱歉抱歉，吓过头了。没有害处的，冷静下来，深呼吸，再随便跳两下，然后看看这个。","model":"subaru_tshirt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10250051:32","scenario_id":32,"scene_id":"scene:10250051","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ロム爺","text":"これは……儂とフェルトの顔、じゃな。どういう手品じゃ？","translation":"这是……老夫和菲鲁特的脸吧。是什么戏法？","model":"rom01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10250051:33","scenario_id":33,"scene_id":"scene:10250051","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"言ったろ？\nこの道具であんたらの時間を切り取って、\nこの中に閉じ込めたってわけさ","translation":"说过了吧？这个道具把你们的时间截下来，关进了这里。","model":"subaru_tshirt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10250051:34","scenario_id":34,"scene_id":"scene:10250051","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ユリウス","text":"……もしや、それは『ミーティア』か？","translation":"……莫非，那是『魔法器』？","model":"julius_jersey01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10250051:35","scenario_id":35,"scene_id":"scene:10250051","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"『ミーティア』?ああ、そうだ、『ミーティア』だ。どうだ、いい値がつくだろ？","translation":"『魔法器』？啊，没错，就是『魔法器』。怎么样，能卖个好价钱吧？","model":"subaru_tshirt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10250051:36","scenario_id":36,"scene_id":"scene:10250051","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ユリウス","text":"およそ、市井に出回る代物じゃない。値段は……世の好事家がどれだけつけるか、そう簡単に見通せるものではないな","translation":"这种东西几乎不会在市面上流通。价格……世间的收藏家愿意出多少钱，实在难以预料。","model":"julius_jersey01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10250051:37","scenario_id":37,"scene_id":"scene:10250051","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"ご高説どーも、ありがとよ！で、ロム爺、『ミーティア』ってのは……","translation":"多谢你的高见啊！所以，罗姆爷，『魔法器』是……","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10250051:38","scenario_id":38,"scene_id":"scene:10250051","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ロム爺","text":"うむ、魔法使いではない――\nゲートが開いていないものでも、\n魔法を使えるようにできる道具じゃ","translation":"嗯，不是魔法使、连门都没打开的人，也能借它使用魔法的道具。","model":"rom01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10250051:39","scenario_id":39,"scene_id":"scene:10250051","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ユリウス","text":"金銭的価値では、君が持ち込んだ徽章とは比べものにならない。物々交換なら好条件、そう言えるだろう","translation":"论金钱价值，你带来的徽章远远无法与它相比。以物易物的话，可以说条件非常优厚。","model":"julius_jersey01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10250051:40","scenario_id":40,"scene_id":"scene:10250051","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"ってことなら、交渉は成立だな？その徽章、物々交換といこうぜ！","translation":"既然如