,"kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"ういうい、了解。ユーリも、それでいいよな？","translation":"好好，了解。尤里，也没问题吧？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:21","scenario_id":21,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ユリウス","text":"外だろうと中だろうと、私の仕事は君の護衛だ。問題はないよ","translation":"不论在外面，还是里面，我的工作都是保护你。没有问题。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:22","scenario_id":22,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"ああ、頼んだぜ。こっからが、正念場ってやつだ……","translation":"嗯，拜托了。接下来，才是真正的关键……","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:23","scenario_id":23,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"text","title_mode":"","speaker":"","text":"――盗品蔵・夕方","translation":"——赃物库·傍晚","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:24","scenario_id":24,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ロム爺","text":"おっと、きたようじゃな。ちと外すぞい","translation":"哦，好像来了。我离开一下。","model":"rom01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:25","scenario_id":25,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ユリウス","text":"スバル、ーつ教えてくれ。この交渉、『腸狩り』にどう繋がる？","translation":"昴，告诉我一件事。这场交易，与『猎肠者』有何关联？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:26","scenario_id":26,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"……もうじき、エルザがここにくる。フェルトが持ってきた徽章を回収しに、な","translation":"……艾尔莎很快就会到这里来。为了回收菲鲁特带来的徽章。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:27","scenario_id":27,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ユリウス","text":"その際、『腸狩り』が暴力に訴える可能性がある、か。そのための私というわけだ","translation":"届时，『猎肠者』有可能诉诸暴力，是吗。所以，才需要我。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:28","scenario_id":28,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ユリウス","text":"だが、わざわざ君が徽章を買い取る理由が、わからないな。何故だ？","translation":"但是，我不明白你为什么非要买下徽章。为什么？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:29","scenario_id":29,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"それを持ち主に返すためさ","translation":"为了还给它的主人。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:30","scenario_id":30,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ユリウス","text":"……そうか。いいだろう。今はその答えで納得しておくとするさ","translation":"……这样啊。好吧，目前，就接受这个答案吧。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:31","scenario_id":31,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"助かるぜ。じゃ、あとは俺に任せてくれ","translation":"多谢了。那接下来，就交给我。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:32","scenario_id":32,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"はー、疲れた疲れた。\nったく、あの姉ちゃんしつこいったら\nねーっての……って、ああ？","translation":"哈～累死了，累死了。真是的，那个姐姐，纠缠不休……嗯？","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:33","scenario_id":33,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"なんだよ、この兄ちゃんたちは。先客がいるなんて聞いてね一ぞ","translation":"什么啊，这几个哥哥是谁？没听说还有其他客人。","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:34","scenario_id":34,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ロム爺","text":"それなんじゃがな。連中はお前さんの客じゃよ、客","translation":"关于这个，他们是来找你的客人。","model":"rom01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:35","scenario_id":35,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"はーん。ま、話はわかったよ。けど、いきなりこられても困んだよな","translation":"哼，事情我明白了。不过，突然找上门，我也很为难啊。","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:36","scenario_id":36,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"アタシにアンタらの頼みを聞く義理は\nねーんだ。それぐらいわかってんだろ？","translation":"我可没有，非得答应你们请求的义务。这点，应该明白吧？","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:37","scenario_id":37,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"うまい話ってのは、兄ちゃんたちが信用できる相手だったらの話だろ","translation":"那也得你们是值得信任的人，才算是好生意吧。","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:38","scenario_id":38,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"そっちのアンタはどう思ってんだ？交渉下手な相方に任せっきりかよ？","translation":"那边的你，怎么想？全交给你那不善谈判的搭档吗？","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:39","scenario_id":39,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ユリウス","text":"……私はあくまで彼の護衛だ。ただ、そう前置きした上で付け加えるなら、信頼とは砂の城のようなもの","translation":"……我终究只是他的护卫。不过，在此前提下补充一句，信任，就如同沙之城堡。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:40","scenario_id":40,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ユリウス","text":"形作るのは難しく、容易く崩れやすい。君と我々の間でその溝を埋めるのは容易いことではないだろうね","translation":"筑起来困难，却轻易便会崩塌。要填平你与我们之间的鸿沟，恐非易事。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:41","scenario_id":41,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"ハッ、気取った物言いが気に入らねーが、\nアタシもそいつと同意見だよ","translation":"哈，虽然不喜欢你这装模作样的说法，不过这一点，我倒是同意。","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:42","scenario_id":42,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"嫌な方向に意気投合するなよ……","translation":"别在这种糟糕的方向上，一拍即合啊……","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:43","scenario_id":43,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"お互い、わかり合えねーって同意したんだ。\nそしたら、話はしまいだろ？\nとっととアンタらは……","translation":"彼此都承认，无法相互理解了。那事情不就完了吗？你们赶紧……","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:44","scenario_id":44,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ユリウス","text":"いや？それは早計だ。私は信頼し合うのは困難だと言ったのであって、不可能だと言ったわけではない","translation":"不，那便太过草率。我说的是，建立信任很困难，可并没说，不可能。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:45","scenario_id":45,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"ああ?","translation":"啊？","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:46","scenario_id":46,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ユリウス","text":"無論、努力は必要だ。だが、困難であることは努力をしない理由にはならない","translation":"当然，需要努力。不过，困难，并不是不去努力的理由。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:47","scenario_id":47,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ユリウス","text":"この交渉には意味も意義も見出せる。だから、私は話し合いをまとめるために尽力する。君の質問への答えは以上だ","translation":"这场交涉，有其价值与意义。因此，我会为了促成谈判，尽自己所能。以上，便是对你问题的回答。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:48","scenario_id":48,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"……は、わかったぜ。最初から気に食わね一雰囲気だと思ってたんだが、ピンときた","translation":"……哈，明白了。一开始，就觉得你这气场让人不爽，现在总算懂了。","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040053:49","scenario_id":49,"scene_id":"scene:10040053","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"とっとと失せろよ、騎士様、貴族様。テメーらと話すロは、アタシにはねー！","translation":"赶紧滚吧，骑士大人，贵族老爷。我可没话，跟你们说！","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031a_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10450054:1","scenario_id":1,"scene_id":"scene:10450054","kind":"title","title_mode":"scene","speaker":"","text":"殺意の一撃","translation":"杀意的一击","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"","source_scenario_id":null},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10450054:2","scenario_id":2,"scene_id":"scene:10450054","kind":"text","title_mode":"","speaker":"","text":"――エルザを避けるために素早く交渉し、徽\n章を取り戻そうとしたスバルだったが、やは\nり事はうまく運ばず時は過ぎる……","translation":"——为了避开艾尔莎，昴想迅速完成谈判，取回徽章。然而，事情依旧不顺，时间渐渐流逝……","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10450054:3","scenario_id":3,"scene_id":"scene:10450054","kind":"text","title_mode":"","speaker":"","text":"――盗品蔵・夕方","translation":"——赃物库·傍晚","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10450054:4","scenario_id":4,"scene_id":"scene:10450054","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"話が合ったかと思えば今度はケンカか！いい加減にしてくれ！今は俺との交渉の場面のはずだろ？","translation":"刚觉得你们谈得来，转头又吵起来了！适可而止吧！现在不是该和我谈交易吗？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10450054:5","scenario_id":5,"scene_id":"scene:10450054","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"話は終わりだって言ってんだろ。大体、こっちも依頼されて盗んできたもんを勝手に横流しなんかできるわけね一よ","translation":"不是说了，已经没什么好谈的。而且，人家委托我偷来的东西，怎么可能随便转卖啊。","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10450054:6","scenario_id":6,"scene_id":"scene:10450054","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"……その依頼人、すげぇ色っぽい美人だっただろ？そいつが、すげえ危ない奴って知ってるか？","translation":"……那个委托人，是个特别性感的美女吧？你知道，她是个非常危险的家伙吗？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10450054:7","scenario_id":7,"scene_id":"scene:10450054","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"はあ?なんで兄ちゃんが依頼人のこと……","translation":"哈？为什么哥哥，会知道委托人的事……","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10450054:8","scenario_id":8,"scene_id":"scene:10450054","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"そいつは『腸狩り』のエルザ。関わると碌なことにならねえ。悪いこと言わねえから、徽章を置いてとんずらしろ","translation":"她就是『猎肠者』艾尔莎。跟她扯上关系，没好事的。听我的，把徽章放下，赶紧逃吧。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10450054:9","scenario_id":9,"scene_id":"scene:10450054","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"オイオイ、適当なこと言ってんじゃね一ぞ。誰がそんな話を信じてやると・","translation":"喂喂，别随口胡说八道。谁会相信那种话……","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10450054:10","scenario_id":10,"scene_id":"scene:10450054","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ロム爺","text":"待て、フェルト。聞いた名前じや。確かに、そんな名前の危ない殺し屋がおるという話は儂の耳にも入っておる","translation":"等等，菲鲁特。这个名字，我听说过。确实，我也听说过，有个叫这名字的危险杀手。","model":"rom01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10450054:11","scenario_id":11,"scene_id":"scene:10450054","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"……確かに、堅気って感じの姉ちゃんじゃなかったのは本当だけどよ","translation":"……确实，那个姐姐，看起来不像什么正经人。","model":"felt01","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_pic