d":42,"scene_id":"scene:10040043","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"疑う気持ちもわかるけど、とにかく話を聞いてみてくれ。聞くだけ損はさせねえから","translation":"我懂你为什么怀疑，但总之，先听听吧。光听一听，不会让你吃亏的。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg040b_felthouse","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040043:43","scenario_id":43,"scene_id":"scene:10040043","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"俺が欲しいのは、お前の持ってる徽章だ。それを、何とか譲ってほしい","translation":"我想要的，是你拿着的徽章。希望你，无论如何能转让给我。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg040b_felthouse","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040043:44","scenario_id":44,"scene_id":"scene:10040043","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"リカード","text":"徽章……？そらまた、なんや、けったいなもんやな","translation":"徽章……？这可真是，奇怪的东西啊。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg040b_felthouse","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040043:45","scenario_id":45,"scene_id":"scene:10040043","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"――？\nリカード、なんかあるのか？","translation":"——？里卡多，怎么了？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg040b_felthouse","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040043:46","scenario_id":46,"scene_id":"scene:10040043","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"リカード","text":"いや、こっちの話や。まあ、ワイの知ってるもんとは関係ないやろから、気にせんでええ","translation":"不，自言自语。和俺知道的东西，应该没啥关系，不用在意。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg040b_felthouse","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040043:47","scenario_id":47,"scene_id":"scene:10040043","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"……ま、詳しくは聞かねーよ。アタシにとって重要なのは、それを誰が高く買い取ってくれるかだ","translation":"……算了，我不细问。对我来说，重要的是，谁愿意出更高的价钱。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg040b_felthouse","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040043:48","scenario_id":48,"scene_id":"scene:10040043","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"で、そんな徽章とやらに、兄ちゃんはいくら付けてくれんだよ？","translation":"那么，哥哥愿意给这枚徽章，出多少钱？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg040b_felthouse","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040043:49","scenario_id":49,"scene_id":"scene:10040043","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"『ミーティア』ぁ？ 初めて見るけど、\nこれがそんなすげーもんなのかよ？","translation":"『流星』？第一次见，这东西，真有那么了不起？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg040b_felthouse","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040043:50","scenario_id":50,"scene_id":"scene:10040043","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"リカード","text":"なんや、えらいもん持ち出したなあ。それ、本当に値打ちもんなんか？","translation":"啥啊，还真拿出了个不得了的东西。那真的值钱吗？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg040b_felthouse","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040043:51","scenario_id":51,"scene_id":"scene:10040043","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"わりーけど、アタシじゃ判断つかねーよ。だから、わかる奴に見せるのが筋だ","translation":"不好意思，我可判断不来。所以，理应找懂的人看看。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg040b_felthouse","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040043:52","scenario_id":52,"scene_id":"scene:10040043","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"貧民街の奥にある盗品蔵。そこにいる口ム爺って偏屈爺さんに鑑定してもらうのが公平だぜ","translation":"贫民区深处，有座赃物库。找那里的怪脾气老头，罗姆爷，鉴定一下，才算公平。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg040b_felthouse","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040043:53","scenario_id":53,"scene_id":"scene:10040043","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"うぐ……結局、そうなっちまうのかよ……","translation":"唔……到头来，还是这样吗……","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg040b_felthouse","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040043:54","scenario_id":54,"scene_id":"scene:10040043","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"リカード","text":"なんや兄ちゃん、乗り気やない面やけど、大丈夫か？","translation":"怎么，小哥，看起来不太乐意，没事吧？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","ac