ion":"什、什么什么！？为什么突然这么热情喵！？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:14","scenario_id":14,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"ふむ……察するに、\nフェリスの知人でしょうか？","translation":"唔……看来，是菲莉丝的熟人？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:15","scenario_id":15,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"おっと、ヴィルヘルムさんも一緒だったか！\n助かる。これで、どうにかなりそうだ","translation":"哦，威尔海姆先生也在一起啊！太好了，这下就有办法了。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:16","scenario_id":16,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"フェリスだけでなく、私のことも？\nどこかでお会いしたことがありましたか？","translation":"不仅是菲莉丝，连我也认识？我们曾在哪里见过吗？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:17","scenario_id":17,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"フェリちゃんも記憶ににゃいけど……\nこんな変わった子、一度会ったら\nそうそう忘れないはずだよネ","translation":"菲莉酱也不记得喵……这么特别的孩子，见过一次应该很难忘记呢。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:18","scenario_id":18,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"悪いごめん、気にしないでくれ。\nこっちが一方的に知ってるだけなんだ","translation":"抱歉抱歉，别在意。只是我单方面认识你们而已。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:19","scenario_id":19,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"それで気にするなって、\n無理があると思うんだけど。\nそれに、それ……","translation":"这样还叫人别在意，实在太勉强了吧。而且，那个……","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:20","scenario_id":20,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"ああ、変な音の正体か。\nこれはビニール袋ってもんだ。\n軽くて便利、水にも濡れない代物だよ","translation":"啊，奇怪的声音的来源？这是塑料袋，轻便好用，还不怕水。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:21","scenario_id":21,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"もちろん、危ないものも入れてねえ。そこは大いに安心してくれ！","translation":"当然，里面也没装危险的东西，这一点尽管放心！","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:22","scenario_id":22,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"何、そのあたかも用意してたような返事……\n君、ちょっと怪しくにゃい？","translation":"这回答怎么像是事先准备好的……你是不是有点可疑喵？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:23","scenario_id":23,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"にゃはは、確かにそんな珍しい格好して\n不思議な持ち物をぶら下げてたら、\n誰でも気にして聞いちゃいそうだネ","translation":"喵哈哈，确实，打扮这么少见，还带着奇妙的东西，谁都会好奇地问问吧。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:24","scenario_id":24,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"ととと、話し込みたいとこなんだが、\n生憎とそんな余裕がないんだ","translation":"啊，虽然很想多聊聊，可惜现在实在没那个余裕。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:25","scenario_id":25,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"実は、二人の力を見込んだ上で、大事な相談をさせてほしい。そのために、二人のことを探してたんだ","translation":"其实，我看中了两位的本领，有件重要的事想商量。为此，我一直在找你们。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:26","scenario_id":26,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"……なるほど。\n我々のことを事前に調べて知っていた、\nといったところでしょうか","translation":"……原来如此。也就是说，事先调查过，所以知道我们的情况？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:27","scenario_id":27,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"まあ、そんなところです。\n理解が早くて助かるぜ！","translation":"差不多就是这样。你理解得这么快，真是帮大忙了！","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:28","scenario_id":28,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"うーん。\nそう言われても、こっちとしては当然、\n君のことを信用できないよネ","translation":"嗯……就算你这么说，我们当然也没办法信任你吧。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:29","scenario_id":29,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"とにかく、話だけでも聞いてくれないか？\nどうかこの通りだ！","translation":"总之，至少听我说说，可以吗？拜托了！","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:30","scenario_id":30,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"かなりお困りの様子ですな。\nフェリス、話ぐらいは聞いてもよいのでは？","translation":"看来确实十分困扰。菲莉丝，听一听也无妨吧？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:31","scenario_id":31,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"え～っ？ しょうがにゃいなぁ……。\nヴィル爺がそう言うんなら、\nちょっとだけだよ？","translation":"诶～？真没办法喵……既然威尔爷这么说，就听一小会儿哦？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:32","scenario_id":32,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"ありがたい！ 助かる！","translation":"太感谢了！帮大忙了！","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:33","scenario_id":33,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"実は、貧民街でちょっとしたいざこざが\n起こりそうなんだが、それに俺の恩人が\n巻き込まれちまってるんだ","translation":"其实，贫民街可能会发生一场冲突，而我的救命恩人也被卷了进去。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:34","scenario_id":34,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"そのいざこざの原因ってのがかなりヤバい\n奴で、その場に居合わせてる住人も含めて、\n何人も命が危ないって状況なんだよ","translation":"引起冲突的是个相当危险的家伙，包括在场的居民，好几个人的命都有危险。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:35","scenario_id":35,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"うええ、何それ。\nその話、ホントなの？","translation":"呜诶，那是什么情况？你说的是真的吗？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:36","scenario_id":36,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"いきなりこんな荒唐無稽な嘘つくかよ。\nとにかく、そのいざこざを止めたいんだが、俺\nだけじゃ無理なんだ。それで……","translation":"我会一上来就编这种荒唐的谎吗？总之，我想阻止这场冲突，可只靠我办不到。所以……","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:37","scenario_id":37,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"――我々の助力を仰ぎにきたと","translation":"——于是来请求我们的帮助。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:38","scenario_id":38,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"――。そうです。\n何とか、力を貸してください","translation":"——是的。请务必助我一臂之力。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:39","scenario_id":39,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"……ふむ。\nちなみに、あなたがそうまでして助けたいと\n思うお相手とは、どのような方なのですか？","translation":"……唔。顺便问一下，您如此想救的人，是一位怎样的人？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:40","scenario_id":40,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"そうだな……お人好しの、銀髪美少女。\n俺の知ってることは、そのぐらいさ","translation":"这个嘛……一个烂好人的银发美少女。我知道的，也就这些。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:41","scenario_id":41,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"――？ 知ってることって、それだけ？\nそれだけで、危ないところに\n自分から飛び込んでこうっていうの？","translation":"——？你知道的就只有这些？就为了这些，就要主动冲进危险的地方？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:42","scenario_id":42,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"ああ、そうだよ。自分でも馬鹿だと思う。\nけど、見過ごせねえんだ。馬鹿だと思うなら\n思ってくれ。でも、本気なんだ","translation":"嗯，没错。我自己也觉得很傻。可我就是没办法坐视不管。你们想怎么觉得都行，但我是认真的。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:43","scenario_id":43,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"なるほど、気迫は十分に。\nフェリス、私は彼の言葉に嘘はないと\n感じますが、あなたは？","translation":"原来如此，气魄十足。菲莉丝，我认为他没有说谎，您觉得呢？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:44","scenario_id":44,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"もう、ヴィル爺ったら……\nあのね、君。いきなりそんな話をされても、\n「はい、任せて」なんて言うと思う？","translation":"真是的，威尔爷……听着，突然说这种事，你觉得我会说『好，交给我吧』吗？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:45","scenario_id":45,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"このいざこざの原因には、\n特別な徽章が関係してる。\nそれでも、力を貸してはもらえないか？","translation":"这场冲突的起因，和一枚特殊的徽章有关。就算这样，也不能帮我吗？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:46","scenario_id":46,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"――！","translation":"——！","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:47","scenario_id":47,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"特別な徽章……ちょっと待って、\nさっき銀髪の女の子って言ったよね？","translation":"特殊的徽章……等等，你刚才说银发的女孩，对吧？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:48","scenario_id":48,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"銀髪の“超”美少女な！\n俺は、その子のことを助けてあげたいんだ","translation":"是银发的『超级』美少女！我想救的，就是那个女孩。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:49","scenario_id":49,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"……まさか、そんなこと……ありえる？\nこれが本当の話だったとしたら……","translation":"……难道，那种事……有可能吗？如果真是这样的话……","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:50","scenario_id":50,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"ねえ、ヴィル爺はどう思う？","translation":"喂，威尔爷，你怎么看？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:51","scenario_id":51,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"彼の言うことが事実であれば、無下に断るわけにもいきますまい","translation":"若他所言属实，我们便不能随意拒绝。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:52","scenario_id":52,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"守るための剣……\nあなたはこの私に、\nそれを求めると仰いますか……","translation":"守护他人的剑……您希望我这把剑，做到这件事吗……","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:53","scenario_id":53,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"委細、承知しました。あなたに代わり、この剣を振るいましょう","translation":"事情我明白了。我会代您挥舞这把剑。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:54","scenario_id":54,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"ほ、本当か！？\nありがとう、ヴィルヘルムさん！","translation":"真、真的吗！？谢谢你，威尔海姆先生！","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:55","scenario_id":55,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"もう、ヴィル爺ってば甘いんだから……。\nまあ、事情が事情って感じだし、\nフェリちゃんはどうしたもんかなぁ","translation":"真是的，威尔爷就是心软……算了，情况特殊，菲莉酱又该怎么办呢？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:56","scenario_id":56,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"ふーん。フェリちゃんの立場を、\n利用しようってわけ～？\nしょうがにゃい。君の口車に乗ったげるよ","translation":"哼～想利用菲莉酱的身份吗？没办法喵，就上你这个当吧。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:57","scenario_id":57,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"すまねえ、本当に助かるぜ!","translation":"谢谢，真的帮大忙了！","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:58","scenario_id":58,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"うん、気にしにゃいでいいよ。\n私たちが自分自身で決めたことだからネ","translation":"嗯，别在意喵。这是我们自己的决定。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040035:59","scenario_id":59,"scene_id":"scene:10040035","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"……ありがとう、二人とも。俺はナツキ・スバルだ、よろしくな！","translation":"……谢谢你们两位。我叫菜月昴，请多关照！","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg069a_fountain","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040036:1","scenario_id":1,"scene_id":"scene:10040036","kind":"title","title_mode":"scene","speaker":"","text":"不和と警告","translation":"不和与警告","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"","source_scenario_id":null},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040036:2","scenario_id":2,"scene_id":"scene:10040036","kind":"text","title_mode":"","speaker":"","text":"――盗品蔵に到着したスバルたちだが、フェ\nルトとエルザの姿はなかった。それ以前に、\nスバルたちにはある問題が残されていた……","translation":"——昴一行来到赃物库，却不见菲鲁特和艾尔莎的身影。而在那之前，他们还有一个问题没有解决……","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"bg/bg027b_stealshop","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg027b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040036:3","scenario_id":3,"scene_id":"scene:10040036","kind":"text","title_mode":"","speaker":"","text":"――盗品蔵の前・夕刻","translation":"——赃物库前·傍晚","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg027b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040036:4","scenario_id":4,"scene_id":"scene:10040036","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ロム爺","text":"――。","translation":"——。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg027b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040036:5","scenario_id":5,"scene_id":"scene:10040036","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"……いや、\nやっぱなんか因縁があるよね？\n間違いなくありますよね？","translation":"……不，你们果然有什么恩怨吧？肯定有吧？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg027b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040036:6","scenario_id":6,"scene_id":"scene:10040036","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"まさか。このような御仁は存じ上げませんな。何も含むところはありません","translation":"怎么会。我不认识这位，也并无任何芥蒂。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg027b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040036:7","scenario_id":7,"scene_id":"scene:10040036","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ロム爺","text":"……儂もこんなジジイ知らんわい","translation":"……老夫也不认识这种老头。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg027b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040036:8","scenario_id":8,"scene_id":"scene:10040036","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"スバル","text":"いやいやいや、\nいくら何でも無理があるだろ、それ！\nどう考えたってこの空気は……","translation":"不不不，再怎么说，这借口也太勉强了！怎么看，这气氛都……","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg027b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040036:9","scenario_id":9,"scene_id":"scene:10040036","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェリス","text":"ス～バ～ル～きゅん。\nこの問題、深く立ち入らない方がいいって\nフェリちゃん思うな～","translation":"昴～亲～菲莉酱觉得，这件事还是别深究比较好哦。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg027b_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10040036:10","scenario_id":10,"scene_id":"scene:10040036","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ロム爺","text":"ふん。ここはお前さんたちのような連中が\