,"scenario_id":17,"scene_id":"scene:10460037","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ヴィルヘルム","text":"闇に紛れたつもりでも、その殺気までは隠しようがありませんな","translation":"即使藏身于黑暗，那股杀气也无法隐藏。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031c_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10460037:18","scenario_id":18,"scene_id":"scene:10460037","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"フェルト","text":"気配?それに殺気だ?いったい、何の話をしてやがんだよ","translation":"气息？还有杀气？你们到底在说什么？","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031c_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10460037:19","scenario_id":19,"scene_id":"scene:10460037","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"エルザ","text":"自分の判断にずいぶんと自信があるのね。そんな風に言われると、少し傷付くわ","translation":"对自己的判断这么有自信啊。被这么说，真有些伤心。","model":"","body":"","face":"","extra_motions":[],"bank":"","cue":"","bg_picture":"","bg_music":"","character_image":"","movie_resource":"","actors":[],"voice_delay_ms":0,"fx_emission_times":[],"command":["","",""],"phases":[[],[],[]],"music":{"action":"inherit","resource":"","fade":1,"restart":false},"script_background":{"mode":"native_array","resource":"bg/bg031c_stealshop","source_scenario_id":2},"native_video":null,"native_unsupported":""},{"id":"10460037:20","scenario_id":20,"scene_id":"scene:10460037","kind":"card","title_mode":"","speaker":"ス